OL,3,GNEWSAArrests as migrant boat reaches UK
OL,4,Aunintercepted
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive people have been detained and sent
OL,7,Fto border security command after a
OL,8,Fmigrant boat reached Kent without being
OL,9,Fintercepted.
OL,11,FThe dinghy made it to shore at
OL,12,FFolkestone on Monday morning. The Home
OL,13,FOffice says an investigation has begun.
OL,15,FAll on the boat are believed to have
OL,16,Fbeen accounted for.
OL,18,FThe thousands of migrants who cross the
OL,19,FChannel are usually brought to shore by
OL,20,Fborder security command or RNLI boats
OL,21,Fbut this one is thought to have slipped
OL,22,Fthrough undetected.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
